                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Summary.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>Incloses, July 25, a note addressed on July 22 by the Dean to the Wai Chiao Pu
                    formally conveying the Diplomatic Body’s demand for interest on all settled
                    claims at 5% from January 1, 1913.</p>
